## Focus mix: 40 Hz gamma + 24 Hz beta binaural beats over a pink-noise bed
##
## Two independent binaural pairs with well-separated carriers so the
## beats don't smear into each other:
##
##   180 Hz carrier, 40 Hz beat   gamma -- fast active processing / attention
##   320 Hz carrier, 24 Hz beat   high beta -- alert, concentrated focus
##
## Amplitudes are on the 0-100 scale; total per tone-set kept under 100
## to avoid clipping.  Pink noise is sbagen's native noise bed.
##
## Headphones required -- binaural beats collapse on speakers.
## Keep playback volume low; the tones should sit just above the noise.
##
## Play live (ALSA build, stops after the hour):
##   dev/sbagen-fixed sequences/focus-40-24-pink.sbg
## Render 30 minutes to a file:
##   LENGTH=00:30:00 ./mksounds.sh focus-40-24-pink sequences/focus-40-24-pink.sbg

all-off: -

focus-40-24: pink/20 180+40/30 320+24/25

0:00:00 focus-40-24
1:00:00 all-off
